Desktop Dock P1 isolated Windows icon verification
Windows 11 25H2, x64. Microsoft .NET SDK 10.0.404, Desktop Runtime 10.0.15.
Built temporary net10.0-windows WPF console harness with workspace DockIconService.cs and DockModels.cs.
Fixtures: Windows System32 notepad.exe; WScript.Shell .lnk targeting that EXE and using shell32.dll icon index 3; a text file; a directory; a URL; a 2x2 PNG whose alpha values are 255, 0, 128, 0; a missing PNG path.
No target was opened. Icon extraction did not request a favicon. This harness probes returned ImageSource pixels and references; it does not exercise Dock rendering or tooltip interactions.

